'''Sprawl''' is a {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Sprawl''' can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Sprawl''' is {{Green|1500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|15%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked.

